docs(vue): refresh stale @c15t/styles references in plan.md

The styles package dissolved into @c15t/ui/styles/v3 (merged 3f518475);
plan.md still pointed contractors at the old specifiers.

fix(nextjs): point main at the CJS build

@c15t/core and @c15t/react both point main at dist/index.cjs, but
@c15t/nextjs pointed it at the ESM dist/index.js — a legacy resolver
that ignores exports and requires through main would load ESM.

docs: scope the bundled-docs claim to the packages that ship docs

@c15t/iab, @c15t/node-sdk, @c15t/schema, @c15t/translations — and
@c15t/backend on the v3 line — publish only built output, so the page
now names the packages that actually bundle docs (core, react, nextjs,
scripts, cli, plus the umbrella AGENTS.md index) and points agents at
c15t.com for the rest.
